flowchart TD
    P[Player] -->|Register| R[POST /auth/register]
    P -->|Login| L[POST /auth/login]
    L -->|Bearer token| T[Auth token]
    T -->|Authorized| Q[GET /sessions/:code/question]
    T -->|Submit answer| A[POST /sessions/:code/answers]
    Q -->|Question + options| P
    A -->|Points + correctness| A2[POST /sessions/:code/answers]
    A2 -->|Next question| N[POST /sessions/:code/advance]
    N --> Q
    N -->|Last question| C[POST /sessions/:code/close]
    C -->|Ended| R2[GET /results]
    style P fill:#e1f5e1
    style L fill:#e1f5e1
    style Q fill:#e3f2fd
    style A fill:#e3f2fd
    style N fill:#e3f2fd
    style C fill:#fff3e0
    style R2 fill:#fff3e0